# Force LF line endings on every platform.
#
# The bundled scaffolds ship a `.dlt/.toolkits` manifest containing sha3_256
# hashes of the vendored AI files. Those hashes are byte-sensitive, so a CRLF
# vs LF difference (e.g. Git-for-Windows `core.autocrlf=true`) changes the hash
# even when the content is logically identical — which makes `make generate-ai`
# / `check-ai` diverge across operating systems. Pinning LF keeps every
# checkout byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf
